; Haline AI installer messages -- English
[Messages]
WelcomeLabel2=This wizard will install [name/ver] on your computer.%n%nHaline AI adds the η tool to the Krita toolbox, which corrects your strokes automatically: lines, circles, rectangles, triangles, sine curves and polylines.%n%nClosing Krita before continuing is recommended.
WizardSelectDir=Krita folder
SelectDirDesc=Where is Krita installed?
SelectDirLabel3=Haline AI will be installed inside the Krita folder (lib\kritaplugins). Confirm the Krita installation folder below.
SelectDirBrowseLabel=Click Next to continue. If Krita is in another folder, click Browse.
FinishedLabelNoIcons=Haline AI has been installed into Krita.%n%nOpen Krita and choose the η tool in the toolbox, or press Ctrl+Alt+H.

[CustomMessages]
LaunchKrita=Open Krita now
KritaRunning=Krita is running. Close Krita and click Retry.
KritaNotFound=Krita was not found in this folder (missing bin\krita.exe).%nChoose the folder where Krita is installed.
KritaVersionMismatch=This plugin targets Krita %1.x, but Krita %2 was found.%nIt may not load on that version. Install anyway?
